            "review_title": "Review at Xa Cafe",
            "review_text": "Cynthia\nBrisbane, Australia13 contributions\n0\nHidden Gem\nFeb 2020 • Friends\nAbsolutely lovely meal and dining area! The vegetarian tofu meal was amazingly tasty and filling. \nThe greens on the side were bouncing with flavour! \n\nAsiana Link Tours dropped us off after our tour and we were all quite pleased with our meals. Would highly recommend!\n\nExcuse my poor photography- I couldn’t wait to tuck into the food!\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 8, 2020",
