            "review_title": "Review at Xa Cafe",
            "review_text": "GuiWong\nAurora, Canada4712 contributions\n1\nCozy But Drinks Are Pricey\nNov 2019 • Couples\nOur tour company dropped us off for a complimentary lemon grass chicken lunch. We didn’t see the food menu but ordered drinks that were average but pricey. \nThe chicken was delicious with very flavourable sauce. Toilets ok. \nService was efficient. \nVery narrow set of stairs to reach the restaurant that is on the second floor. Cozy atmosphere with books and cards available.\nRead more\nWritten November 14, 2019",
