            "review_text": "Yulianaismyname\nBali, Indonesia504 contributions\n0\nLovely small cafe\nJun 2018 • Friends\nI knew this place from my friend, it might be a little bit difficult to get there if you’re not local, because the cafe / restaurant location is almost in the corner of the alley, and it’s in the 2nd floor, with small gate open. \nBut once we got there, we like it, small place but very warm atmosphere. I ordered pork teriyaki, it was lovely. \nFood : 9 / 10\nService : 9,5 / 10\nLocation : 7 / 10\nRead more\nWritten June 17, 2018",
